      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stewart%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Stewart sits along the Hocking River just upstream from where Federal Creek joins, giving it a scenic riverside location.",
